1
00:00:00,851 --> 00:00:02,351
(Penny:)Oh, you are such a--

2
00:00:02,519 --> 00:00:03,599
[BLENDER WHIRRING]

3
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:06,560
(Penny:)-What the hell is he doing?
-Drowning us out. He doesn't like fighting.

4
00:00:06,732 --> 00:00:09,272
(Penny:)Sheldon, just stop.
Look, the fight is over.

5
00:00:09,443 --> 00:00:12,573
(Penny:)Oh, and FYI. You never even heard
of the Black Eyed Peas...

6
00:00:12,738 --> 00:00:13,778
(Penny:)...until you met me.

7
00:00:13,947 --> 00:00:16,077
I heard of them.

8
00:00:16,742 --> 00:00:19,452
I didn't know they were a band.

9
00:00:20,662 --> 00:00:23,042
(Leonard:)Sheldon, she's gone.
You can turn off the blender.

10
00:00:23,207 --> 00:00:24,957
[BLENDER STOPS]

11
00:00:29,296 --> 00:00:33,346
(Sheldon:)Has your relationship reached
its inevitable ugly end?

12
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:37,134
(Leonard:)No, we just had a little spat.

13
00:00:37,304 --> 00:00:40,394
(Sheldon:)Look on the bright side.
As a result of Penny's forfeit...

14
00:00:40,557 --> 00:00:44,937
(Sheldon:)...you have become
the world's first winner of Research Lab.

15
00:00:45,103 --> 00:00:50,023
(Sheldon:)Would you like a commemorative
snow cone?

